    "sections": {
        "description": "The Coworking Office theme is designed for shared workspaces, startup hubs, and flexible office environments that need a clean and structured online presence. It includes well-defined sections for workspace listings, membership plans, team profiles, and booking details. The layout supports clear navigation and organized content display, making it suitable for coworking space websites, business centers, and rental office platforms. Built with a lightweight structure, the theme ensures efficient performance and easy customization through the customizer. This theme supports responsive design, modern layout, typography control, and integration with essential plugins. It is suitable for office rental websites, meeting room booking, shared workspace directories, and startup communities. With compatibility for block editor, SEO-friendly structure, fast loading speed, and minimal design elements, the Coworking Office theme helps present workspace services clearly without unnecessary complexity."
    },
